[{"answer":"Hello, Steynford College external course registration, can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I'm ringing to find out about one-day classes next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I got a leaflet about them in the post but I lost it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I understand some of the classes are filling up fast,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/4.mp3"},{"answer":"so I might need to book quite soon if I want to go ahead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you remember which one you were considering?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/7.mp3"},{"answer":"There were a few actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I remember there was one on how to make Vietnamese food that sounded good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that was on the 13th of January.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It cost about £60.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you're right about the date, but it's £59 actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/12.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a very popular class,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and among other things the teacher explains how Vietnamese food includes lots of different herbs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid that all the places are taken at present,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but I can put you on the waiting list if you want?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/16.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm quite interested in the bread making class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/18.mp3"},{"answer":"That's in March sometime, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, the 20th of March.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like to register for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/22.mp3"},{"answer":"How much is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/23.mp3"},{"answer":"The actual cost is £48","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/24.mp3"},{"answer":"but then there's an extra charge as well as that for the ingredients.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure how much that is, no more than £20 I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/26.mp3"},{"answer":"So what sorts of things do they make in the class?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, various types of bread;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they make white bread and then they make sourdough,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/29.mp3"},{"answer":"that seems to be very fashionable at present,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and they learn how to make pizza, which is apparently really good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Well I'd definitely be interested in that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/32.mp3"},{"answer":"but there were also a few other classes that sounded interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I think there was one on face massage?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd love to learn how to do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's on the 23rd of February","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and it costs just £35 for the day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/37.mp3"},{"answer":"The teacher's great,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/38.mp3"},{"answer":"the type of massage done is a traditional technique used in India","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and she actually did her training there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/40.mp3"},{"answer":"The massage is meant to relax you and get rid of lines and wrinkles.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/41.mp3"},{"answer":"You practise it on yourself","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/42.mp3"},{"answer":"so you have to take a mirror to the class, so you can see what you're doing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/44.mp3"},{"answer":"And I think there was a class in candle making?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes that's sometime in April, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me check...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... yes, it's on the 6th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/48.mp3"},{"answer":"It was on the 23rd of January but they had to change the date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just £52.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/50.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a popular course too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I think one reason why people like it is because the candles are all made out of natural products.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/52.mp3"},{"answer":"It's filling up fast but there's still a few places left.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes one of my friends did that class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/54.mp3"},{"answer":"She said the candles make really good presents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/55.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact she gave me one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/56.mp3"},{"answer":"By the way, have you heard about the class on silk painting?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/57.mp3"},{"answer":"That's being held on the 18th of May.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/58.mp3"},{"answer":"You learn how to create designs on silk fabric and colour them using special dyes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently people can produce beautiful artworks that way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/60.mp3"},{"answer":"either to put on the wall as a picture or to use for something like a scarf.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It's £67.50,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/62.mp3"},{"answer":"which is really good value I think,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/63.mp3"},{"answer":"there's a similar class I've seen that was £110.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/64.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Would I need to bring the silk?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/66.mp3"},{"answer":"No, the only thing is everyone has to bring something to protect their clothing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/67.mp3"},{"answer":"like an apron if you've got one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/68.mp3"},{"answer":"or a shirt that you don't use any more,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/69.mp3"},{"answer":"because the dye can really stain your clothes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the last class I was considering was a bit different,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/72.mp3"},{"answer":"that was on DIY for beginners.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to learn how to do household repairs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there any places left on that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/75.mp3"},{"answer":"That's on the 24th of February,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/76.mp3"},{"answer":"yes, there are a few places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/77.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a bit more expensive,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/78.mp3"},{"answer":"it's £125,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/79-2026-07-31-05-20-29.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's a very popular class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/80.mp3"},{"answer":"You learn how to use an electric drill and a saw.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that would be really useful,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/82.mp3"},{"answer":"and I even need to learn how to use a hammer","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/83.mp3"},{"answer":"because I always end up hitting my fingers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you'll do that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/85.mp3"},{"answer":"And when you've learned how to use the basic tools, you do a practical job","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/86.mp3"},{"answer":"which is fixing a shelf to a wall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. Just what I need to know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well I'd like to enrol for that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam21-test-2-part-1-2026-07-17-16-12-53/89.mp3"}]
